<title>JAPAN: Nippon Steel says wins $100 mln Brazil order.</title>
<headline>Nippon Steel says wins $100 mln Brazil order.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Steel Corp said on Wednesday it had won an order worth $100 million from Brazilian steel maker Usinas Siderurgicas de Minas Gerais SA.</p>
</text>
